  "title": "Huey Showcased in Malaysia",
  "description": "Members of Malaysia’s armed forces, alongside Malaysian and U.S. government officials, observed a theater security cooperation event with the 31st Marine Expeditionary Unit Feb. 27. Two UH-1Y Venom “Huey” helicopters demonstrate live fire and close air support using a GAU-17/A Gatling gun, a GAU-31 .50-caliber machinegun and 70mm rocket fire at Sepanggar, Sabah, Malaysia.  The Huey’s departed from the USS Bonhomme Richard and are with Marine Medium Tiltrotor Squadron 262 (reinforced), 31st MEU. The 31st MEU is the only continuously forward deployed MEU and is currently conducting Spring Patrol 2015. Also available in high definition.",
